# Trust: Bastok (bastok 92): Ayame's 985 against another quest's handler at the same NPC. Trust: Bastok completed (by
# GM) and Out of the Depths accepted (by GM), whose Ayame reminder is Event(860) with setPriority 101: it outranks
# Trust: Bastok's 985 (an Event, priority 100), so Ayame plays 860. A progress event (1000) would outrank the reminder
# and play 985, so this flow fixes 985 as an Event. Ayame is not yet learned (985 would be offered). Out of the Depths
# done (GM) afterwards, 985 plays again.
lists Metalworks/Ayame/onTrigger
char zone=Metalworks pos=64,-14,-4 lvl=75 nation=1
quest Bastok.TrustBastok completed
quest Bastok.OutOfTheDepths accepted
login
trigger Ayame                  # Out of the Depths' reminder wins (101 over Trust: Bastok's event, 100): 860
finish
quest Bastok.OutOfTheDepths completed
trigger Ayame                  # Out of the Depths done: Trust: Bastok's 985 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=0
